  "Nodes": {
    "entry-00000": {
      "Id": "entry-00000",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The little archive that remembers your outfits. Every time you save a look, a loom stitches its cut and color into a pattern record. Wear it again, and the record tells your clothes what to become.\n\nMost lockers are cheap Czerka work. Twenty-five patterns, then they choke.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Materials no broker on this moon will sell me. Bigger lockers need wider looms, finer brushes, truer color references. I take them from the galaxy's nastiest animals, by way of people like you.\n\nFive rebuilds, five looks each. Fifty is the most any locker holds without losing its mind.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Mind the silk. That bolt costs more than your boots.\n\nYou have the look of someone whose pattern locker is full. Twenty-five looks and not one slot to spare. I rebuild lockers. It isn't quick, and I don't take credits for it.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Old Scar's silver ruff. He's a kath hound on Viscara, the scarred brute that runs with the packs. Stormplume's sheen down, from the big warocas over the same hills. And a Pattern Thread Spool: any smith who works fiberplast can make one at level 5, or you can buy one from a crafter.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-can-accept-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-on-quest-state",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_1",
                "1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Bring all three at once. I don't keep half-built looms on my bench.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Well? Ruff, down and a spool. I see none of them on my bench.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00006": {
      "Id": "entry-00006",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "All three. Hold still, the loom is loud.\n\nThere. Your pattern locker holds thirty looks now. Try not to fill it with beige.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00009",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00009": {
      "Id": "entry-00009",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Back already? Let me guess: thirty looks, and the locker is choking again.\n\nThe next rebuild needs a wider loom. Wider looms need better parts.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00011",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00007": {
      "Id": "entry-00007",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A dye gland from the Silkshade Matriarch, the kinrath queen on Viscara. A prism lens from the Shard-Eye Matriarch, one of Viscara's crystal spiders. And a Pattern Loom Heddle, smithed at level 15.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00011",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-can-accept-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_2"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00012",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-on-quest-state",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_2",
                "1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_2"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_2"
              ],
              "IsNegated": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00008": {
      "Id": "entry-00008",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The Matriarchs don't share. Bring a crew.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00010": {
      "Id": "entry-00010",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Gland, lens, heddle. The loom is waiting and so am I.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00012",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00013",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00011": {
      "Id": "entry-00011",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The lens is flawless. Give me a moment to fit the heddle.\n\nDone. Thirty-five looks. Your locker breathes again.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00014",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00014": {
      "Id": "entry-00014",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Thirty-five looks and still hungry. I respect that.\n\nThe third rebuild is where color gets serious. Your locker has to tell a true red from a nearly-red, or every dye you save comes back wrong.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00012": {
      "Id": "entry-00012",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Clan pigment from Harrek Voss, the Mandalorian they call Iron-Stripe on Viscara. He won't hand it over. A sheen scale from Redtail Kor, the raivor on Viscara. And Pattern Template Plates, smithed at level 25.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-can-accept-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_3"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00017",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-on-quest-state",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_3",
                "1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_3"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "wardrobe_expansion_3"
              ],
              "IsNegated": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00013": {
      "Id": "entry-00013",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Mind Voss. Mandalorians take their colors personally.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00015": {
      "Id": "entry-00015",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Pigment, scale, plates. Color doesn't wait forever.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00017",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00018",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00016": {
      "Id": "entry-00016",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "That pigment still smells of Voss's forge. Perfect.\n\nForty looks, and every red where it belongs.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00019",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00019": {
      "Id": "entry-00019",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Forty. Most of my clients stop here, and most of my clients dress like freighter crews.\n\nThe fourth rebuild is heavy work. Bigger lockers pull their threads out of true unless the loom is built to hold them.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00020",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00021",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00017": {
      "Id": "entry-00017",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A bone needle carved from a fang of Maw-Seer Ghal, the Vellen flesheater in the Viscara ruins. The krayt pearl clasp Urrok wears; he's the Tusken Gaderffii champion on Tatooine. And Loom Tension Weights, smithed at level 35.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00021",
          "Conditions": [
